<title>NORWAY: Norway's Nera shows fall in 1996 pre-tax.</title>
<headline>Norway's Nera shows fall in 1996 pre-tax.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to December 31.</p>
<p>			     (millions of crowns unless stated)</p>
<p>Operating income	     172	 vs	   183</p>
<p>Pre-tax profit		 140	 vs	   154</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Norwegian telecommunications company is Nera ASA. A Reuter poll of seven analysts forecast operating profits of 191 million crowns and a pre-tax result of 164 million crowns. Four of the analysts recommended a buy on the share and two said hold.  </p>
<p>Operating revenues	   2,630     vs	 2,367</p>
<p>Net financial items    minus  31     vs   minus  29</p>
<p>After-tax profit		 103     vs	   117</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom, +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
